      "observation": {
        "instruction": "Release the manifest shipment only when its SDS is independently sourced and applies to the manifest SKU; verify the actual packed SKU matches the manifest and that carrier and packaging satisfy the standing handling policy. A shipper's declaration alone is not independent product evidence. Valid air and ground choices should both be completed; otherwise escalate. These are synthetic benchmark rules, not real-world shipping regulations.\n\nartifact.packed_sku is only the shipper's declaration. The actual packed SKU comes from the immutable warehouse_seal_scan record at authority_records.packing_records[shipment_id]. Require a record and require both the manifest and declared packed SKU to match it. Missing records call for review, not guessing. Changing a declaration never changes the physical packing record.",
